@startuml
title UC-001 Seek Travel Advice - Module Interaction
autonumber
actor Customer
participant "MOD-CI\nCustomer Interaction" as CI
participant "MOD-CM\nPerson Management" as CM
participant "MOD-TPM\nTouristic Product Management" as TPM

Customer -> CI: seekTravelAdvice(travelGoals)
CI -> CM: getCustomerContext(customerRef)
CM --> CI: customerContext
CI -> TPM: findTouristicProducts(travelGoals, customerContext)
TPM --> CI: productOptions
CI --> Customer: advice and refinement options
@enduml
